5. WebSocket Event & Data Flow Contract
All WebSocket communications must strictly adhere to the following JSON payload structures to ensure cross-domain compatibility. Do not add or remove payload keys.

MISSION_START: { "mission_id": string, "path_polyline": string, "priority": string }

TELEMETRY_UPDATE: { "mission_id": string, "lat": number, "lng": number, "speed": number }

SIGNAL_PREEMPT: { "intersection_id": string, "phase": "GREEN" }

SIGNAL_RELEASE: { "intersection_id": string, "phase": "ALL_RED" }

INCIDENT_LOGGED: { "lat": number, "lng": number, "type": "OBSTRUCTION" }

ROUTE_UPDATED: { "mission_id": string, "new_polyline": string }

